etween the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in (2,3].$ The corresponding region is a trapezoid. Thus, we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{2}(a+b)h \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(2+4)(1) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-4}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}-{A}_{2}+{A}_{3} \\\\  & =6-2\\pi +3 \\\\  & =9-2\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306200 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306201 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306202 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306203 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306204 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1041 "selection" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1104 #edb/ref 17592186306201 13194139534731 true] [17592186306199 1110 #uuid "f394f966-6c73-55ab-af28-cd289c2d467d" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306200 1034 "11+\\pi " 13194139534731 true] [17592186306200 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534731 true] [17592186306200 1111 #uuid "17280961-b8ed-5aa6-81f7-d8b50b1a9829" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306201 1034 "9-2\\pi " 13194139534731 true] [17592186306201 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534731 true] [17592186306201 1111 #uuid "5c96d804-f537-52e4-b34d-fd4d435b98cc" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306202 1034 "-2+3\\pi " 13194139534731 true] [17592186306202 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534731 true] [17592186306202 1111 #uuid "80b4f644-df23-51c0-8831-2901cfcbe042" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306203 1034 "8-\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306203 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534731 true] [17592186306203 1111 #uuid "ccc19608-29e4-5590-8c3a-58a595a50ab1" 13194139534731 true] [17592186306204 1034 "7+2\\pi " 13194139534731 true] [17592186306204 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534731 true] [17592